This repository documents my experience purchasing and recovering a used Cisco Catalyst 3650-24TD-S switch for my home networking and CCNA lab.

The goal was to:

- Build a real physical networking lab
- Learn enterprise switching hands-on
- Move beyond Packet Tracer simulations
- Practice VLANs, routing, SSH, and enterprise troubleshooting

