# Key Lessons Learned

## Layer 2 vs Layer 3

A switch management IP does not automatically make the switch a router.

Switches primarily forward traffic using:

```text
MAC addresses
```

Routers forward traffic using:

```text
IP routing
```

---

## DNS vs Connectivity

Being able to ping:

```bash
ping 8.8.8.8
```

does NOT guarantee DNS is working.

Websites require:

```text
DNS name resolution
```

